      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-21488-21823"><seg source="#source-21488-21494">一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21494-21512"><rb>方</rb><rt>ぽう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21512-21515">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21515-21530"><rb>山</rb><rt>やま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21530-21536">で、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21536-21548"><rb>切</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21548-21551">り</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21551-21563"><rb>落</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21563-21596">としたようになって、一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21596-21614"><rb>方</rb><rt>ぽう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21614-21617">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21617-21632"><rb>深</rb><rt>ふか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21632-21635">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21635-21650"><rb>深</rb><rt>ふか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21650-21653">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21653-21668"><rb>崖</rb><rt>がけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21668-21692">であります。その</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21692-21707"><rb>崖</rb><rt>がけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21707-21710">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21710-21725"><rb>下</rb><rt>した</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21725-21734">には、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21734-21749"><rb>大</rb><rt>おお</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21749-21755">きな</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21755-21770"><rb>波</rb><rt>なみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21770-21773">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21773-21785"><rb>打</rb><rt>う</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21785-21788">ち</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21788-21800"><rb>寄</rb><rt>よ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21800-218